00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.718
Vhidhiyo iyi inoratidza maitiro ekuongorora neurovision uye kuburitsa magirazi.

2
00:00:04.718 --> 00:00:08.020
Geza maoko uye usaite weti.

3
00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:12.737
Iwe unozoda neurovision chati, peni uye makiriniki manotsi, renji

4
00:00:12.737 --> 00:00:17.455
yemagirazi ekuverenga uye chidimbu chetambo chakareba 40cm.

5
00:00:17.455 --> 00:00:21.700
Tsanangura zvauchaita kuti uwane mvumo.

6
00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:25.475
Gadzirisa murwere zvakanaka munzvimbo ine chiedza chakanaka.

7
00:00:25.475 --> 00:00:32.551
